{
  "revision": "S8.4 / P1.4",
  "status": "verified schematic / fit draft, unrouted and not bench-qualified",
  "replaces": "review-s83.json (S8.3 / P1.3 record, git a12edd3)",
  "changelog": [
    {
      "item": "C1",
      "change": "U23 FLT (pin 4) taken off P5_OK: own pull-up R108 + test pad TP21 (net P5_FLT_N), diagnostic only. P5_OK = AUXOFF + U18. Hot plug into a live +5V bus / load release held downstream no longer latches."
    },
    {
      "item": "C2",
      "change": "<6 V at the header stays NOT guaranteed: 3 us case 6.33 V, ~193 us above 6 V; 30 V / 1 ohm / 3 us stress case added (6.52 V). Wording kept plain in doc, calcs and validation."
    },
    {
      "item": "M1",
      "change": "TIMER_GO = RUN AND MAIN_OK (U13 pin 10 was V20_OK): qualification starts with the U2/U3 enable. R83 220k -> 200k re-centres V20_OK (14.6-17.7 V) below the 18.25 V minimum loaded PD input."
    },
    {
      "item": "M2",
      "change": "R11/R12 0.1 % / 25 ppm (setpoint 4.856-5.114 V); calcs ovlo_release (imposed-current model): a release from U23 ILIM max peaks 0.109 V below the OVLO minimum and 0.201 V below the U20 guard; OVLO falling band 5.079-5.336 V computed; the -35 mV reconnect corner stays open (fail-safe latch)."
    },
    {
      "item": "M3",
      "change": "v3v3_loss states: U20 may stay powered from VPD, nothing can be enabled (R64 holds RUN low), node current <= 0.15 mA; D22 is not a guaranteed cold clamp. Stale \"U20 unpowered\" rationale removed."
    },
    {
      "item": "M4",
      "change": "Local-loop contract (check_s8_board LOCAL_LOOPS, board-p1.json local_loops): U23 IN/OUT 22u <= 3.5 mm, D21/D23 <= 6 mm, IC bypass <= 4.5/6 mm. U23 cell re-placed (P1.4); every row passes."
    },
    {
      "item": "M5",
      "change": "Published conservative rating 2.5 / 2.0 / 0.9 A (+12 / +5 / -12 V), <= 45 W delivered, for VPD >= 18.25 V (converter input >= 17.25 V after D10 + U5): 75 % of the minimum capability there, nearest 0.1 A; +5V 2.0 A = 75.6 % of U23 ILIM min, 0.65 A headroom with ITIMER open; not specified below (calcs rating)."
    },
    {
      "item": "M6",
      "change": "-12V start-up per the LMR38020 hiccup rule (|Vout| < 40 % after blanking): hiccup model 1.08 mF at the 15.23 V converter input of the U5 turn-on minimum, 1 A, half blanking; published allowance 0.846 mF (TI ~1000 uF total-COUT guidance minus the rated bank) vs the 0.44 mF typical rack; acceptance test added."
    },
    {
      "item": "M7",
      "change": "U23 copper-pad mask expansion 0.05 -> 0.025 mm: every mask web 0.15 mm (IN/OUT incl.); TP18-to-+5V no-short bring-up check in the notes, validation and doc."
    },
    {
      "item": "M8",
      "change": "Basic-only policy decided: Extended accepted for the ten 0.1 % dividers only (sourcing.json / s84-sourcing.json basic_only_policy); calcs basic_only_counterfactual shows four screens failing with 1 % parts."
    },
    {
      "item": "M9",
      "change": "mechanical.json risks: IDC strain relief 0.4 mm past the 4HP edge (not approved), IDC envelope 1.1 mm margin, case depth, nominal proxies."
    }
  ],
